      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: Abusive; overall-intent-description: The meme depicts Ilhan Omar with text claiming she has 'threatened' members of Congress and made a racially charged, culturally insensitive joke about sending them 'shawarma' to 'give them a taste of her culture.' The final call to action, 'share to say arrest her now!', frames her as a criminal and incites public hostility. This is abusive as it uses false and inflammatory claims to vilify a public official, promotes violence through the call to arrest her, and relies on stereotypes about her Muslim identity and cultural background to dehumanize her. The meme is designed to provoke outrage and incite action against her based on misinformation and prejudice, fitting the definition of abusive content.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_f15369a8"
      },
