      "description": "The top text 'musslamic democrat ilhan omar, has threatened members of congress' explicitly identifies the visual subject (Ilhan Omar) as the 'musslamic democrat' who has threatened members of Congress. This creates an analogical mapping where the textual label 'musslamic democrat ilhan omar' is projected onto the visual entity Ilhan_Omar, establishing her as the subject of the accusation.",
