      "description": "The user is projected onto the final text chunk 'share to say arrest her now!', which explicitly uses an imperative ('share') and a direct call to action ('say arrest her now!'), directing the user to participate in a political campaign against Ilhan Omar. This creates a direct semiotic projection where the user is positioned as an active participant in the meme's abusive intent.",
